Balance Whale Intl is an independent, English-first fork of the DSH widget.

It was inspired by the behavior and feature set of
DeepSeek-Balance-Whale-Widget by MeteorNOX:
https://github.com/MeteorNOX/DeepSeek-Balance-Whale-Widget

The host-side balance resolution, DeepSeek peak/off-peak pricing model, and
turn-usage aggregation follow the same public API contracts and pricing facts
documented by that MIT-licensed project and by DeepSeek. The JavaScript, CSS,
and SVG fallback in this bundle are original to this package.

Artwork and audio are included from the upstream repository at the user's
request: assets/DSniang1.png, assets/rua.gif, assets/Ya1.mp3, assets/Ya2.mp3,
assets/D1.mp3, assets/D2.mp3, assets/cost-default.wav,
assets/minecraft-exp-orb.wav, assets/task-end-a.wav,
assets/ask-default.wav, assets/approve-default.wav, and icon.png.
A transparent-padding-trimmed derivative of the character image is included as
assets/DSniang1-trim.png; it remains under the same as-is terms. Those assets are NOT MIT-licensed by the
upstream project; they are distributed as-is for running this plugin. See
ASSET_PROVENANCE.md for source URLs and checksums. Do not relicense the art or
audio under this package's MIT license.

